  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "The logic followed here is :-\n\nBy using BODMAS RULE :\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/4671232025562bc3ba9a781319d633acf8cd8e78dc8e96912cd7564a7df4717d.png] \n\nOption 1) : + and × \n\nGiven equation is : 756 ÷ 252 + 89 × 180 - 63 = 384\n\nAfter interchanging the two signs the equation is as follows : 756 ÷ 252 × 89 + 180 - 63 = 384\n\n⇒ __**756 ÷ 252**__ × 89 + 180 - 63 = 384\n\n⇒ __**3 × 89**__ + 180 - 63 = 384\n\n⇒ __**267 + 180**__ - 63 = 384\n\n⇒ __**447 - 63**__ = 384\n\n⇒** ****384 = 384**\n\n**LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) : ÷ and -\n\nGiven equation is : 756 ÷ 252 + 89 × 180 - 63 = 384\n\nAfter interchanging the two signs the equation is as follows : 756 - 252 + 89 × 180 ÷ 63 = 384\n\n⇒ 756 - 252 + 89 × __**180 ÷ 63**__ = 384\n\n⇒ 756 - 252 + __**89 × 2.857**__ = 384\n\n⇒ __**756**__ - 252 __**+ 254.2857**__ = 384\n\n⇒ __**1010.2857 - 252**__ = 384\n\n⇒ 758.2857 ≠ 384\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) : - and +\n\nGiven equation is : 756 ÷ 252 + 89 × 180 - 63 = 384\n\nAfter interchanging the two signs the equation is as follows : 756 ÷ 252 - 89 × 180 + 63 = 384\n\n⇒ __**756 ÷ 252**__ - 89 × 180 + 63 = 384\n\n⇒ 3 - __**89 × 180**__ + 63 = 384\n\n⇒ __**3**__ - 16020 __**+ 63**__ = 384\n\n⇒ __**66 - 16020**__ = 384\n\n⇒ 15954 ≠ 384\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) : ÷ and +\n\nGiven equation is : 756 ÷ 252 + 89 × 180 - 63 = 384\n\nAfter interchanging the two signs the equation is as follows : 756 + 252 ÷ 89 × 180 - 63 = 384\n\n⇒ 756 + __**252 ÷ 89**__ × 180 - 63 = 384\n\n⇒ 756 + __**2.831 × 180**__ - 63 = 384\n\n⇒ __**756 + 509.66**__ - 63 = 384\n\n⇒ __**1265.66 - 63**__ = 384\n\n⇒ 1202.66 ≠ 384\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"+ and ×\".**",
